/* MARK: Legal texts */
"legal.privacy.body" = "Your financial data is stored on your device and, if you enabled it, in your private iCloud account. Neither Quantara nor any third party can access it.\n\nThe AI adviser runs in on-device mode by default: nothing is sent. If you enable the advanced AI, only aggregates are transmitted — category totals and ratios — with no transaction descriptions, no merchants and no exact dates. Detailed mode adds descriptions, solely for automatic categorisation, and must be enabled explicitly.\n\nNo financial data is used to train a model without your explicit consent. You can export all your data at any time, and delete it permanently from Settings.";
"legal.terms.body" = "Quantara is a budgeting tool. It does not provide investment, tax or legal advice.\n\nAnalyses and recommendations are based on the information you enter, so their accuracy depends on yours. Projections rest on stated assumptions and are not forecasts.\n\nYou remain solely responsible for your financial decisions.";
"legal.investment.body" = "Investment information in Quantara is provided for educational purposes and does not constitute personalised investment advice within the meaning of applicable regulation.\n\nAll investing carries a risk of capital loss, up to the full amount. Past performance does not predict future performance. No return is guaranteed.\n\nQuantara recommends no product, issuer or intermediary. For advice suited to your situation, consult a licensed financial adviser.";

